{"ticker":"FAST","updated":"2026-10-30T22:48:05Z","profile":{"longName":"Fastenal Company","shortName":"Fastenal Company","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Industrial Distribution","country":"United States","website":"https://www.fastenal.com","fullTimeEmployees":21749,"marketCap":59556421632,"trailingPE":42.20325,"forwardPE":36.79394,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":6.5595827,"pegRatio":3.39,"targetMeanPrice":51.06923,"targetHighPrice":60.0,"targetLowPrice":39.9,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":13,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.155,"earningsGrowth":0.207,"grossMargins":0.44607,"operatingMargins":0.21548,"profitMargins":0.15619999,"totalRevenue":9079300096,"beta":0.69,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":53.3,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":38.97,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.98},"summary":"Fastenal Company, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the wholesale distribution of industrial and construction supplies in the United States, Canada, Mexico, and internationally. It offers fasteners, and related industrial and construction supplies under the Fastenal name. The company's fastener products include threaded fasteners, bolts, nuts, screws, studs, and related washers that are used in manufactured products and construction projects, as well as in the maintenance and repair of machines. It offers miscellaneous supplies and hardware, including pins, machinery keys, concrete anchors, metal framing systems, wire ropes, strut products, rivets, and related accessories. The company serves the manufacturing market comprising original equipment manufacturers; maintenance, repair, and operations customers; non-residential construction market; farmers, truckers, railroads, mining companies, schools, and retail trades; and oil exploration, production, and refinement companies, as well as federal, state, and local governmental entities. Fastenal Company was founded in 1967 and is headquartered in Winona, Minnesota.","summary_zh":"Fastenal Company 及其子公司在美國、加拿大、墨西哥和國際上從事工業和建築用品的批發分銷。它以 Fastenal 名義提供緊固件以及相關工業和建築用品。該公司的緊固件產品包括用於製造產品和建築項目以及機器維護和修理的螺紋緊固件、螺栓、螺母、螺絲、螺柱和相關墊圈。它提供各種用品和硬件，包括銷釘、機械鑰匙、混凝土錨、金屬框架系統、鋼絲繩、支柱產品、鉚釘和相關配件。該公司服務於包括原始設備製造商在內的製造市場；維護、維修和營運客戶；非住宅建築市場；農民、卡車司機、鐵路、礦業公司、學校和零售業；石油勘探、生產和煉油公司，以及聯邦、州和地方政府實體。 Fastenal 公司成立於 1967 年，總部位於明尼蘇達州威諾納。","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"產業分佈","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":49.34,"h":49.61,"l":48.85,"c":49.19,"v":4782800},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":49.19,"h":49.72,"l":49.07,"c":49.52,"v":3729600},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":49.52,"h":50.31,"l":49.16,"c":50.27,"v":6073400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":49.1,"h":49.36,"l":47.38,"c":47.99,"v":9383100},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":48.1,"h":48.35,"l":47.68,"c":48.19,"v":6021400},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":47.88,"h":47.99,"l":47.08,"c":47.9,"v":4194100},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":47.85,"h":48.3,"l":47.65,"c":47.97,"v":4895700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":47.91,"h":48.39,"l":46.59,"c":47.33,"v":12287400},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":47.05,"h":47.59,"l":46.94,"c":47.45,"v":5506500},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":47.45,"h":47.99,"l":47.29,"c":47.76,"v":4502600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":47.74,"h":47.93,"l":46.73,"c":47.25,"v":5579500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":47.44,"h":47.76,"l":46.99,"c":47.12,"v":5126900},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":47.22,"h":47.79,"l":46.82,"c":47.22,"v":5624800},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":47.21,"h":47.76,"l":46.64,"c":47.58,"v":13747600},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":47.55,"h":47.61,"l":47.03,"c":47.12,"v":5786000},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":47.28,"h":48.07,"l":47.13,"c":47.99,"v":5696700},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":48.01,"h":48.36,"l":47.5,"c":47.54,"v":4797400},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":47.6,"h":48.01,"l":47.42,"c":47.85,"v":4327700},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":47.92,"h":48.77,"l":47.79,"c":48.7,"v":4941200},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":48.89,"h":49.3,"l":48.55,"c":48.87,"v":4758500},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":48.79,"h":49.11,"l":48.68,"c":49.04,"v":6660000},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":48.66,"h":49.09,"l":47.56,"c":47.72,"v":7935300},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":47.34,"h":48.22,"l":46.66,"c":48.17,"v":5841700},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":48.05,"h":4